{"id": "ledgar/test/8229", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"This Agreement shall be interpreted and administered in a manner so that any amount or benefit payable hereunder shall be paid or provided in a manner that is either exempt from or compliant with the requirements Section 409A of the Code and applicable Internal Revenue Service guidance and Treasury Regulations issued thereunder. Nevertheless, the tax treatment of the benefits provided under the Agreement is not warranted or guaranteed. Neither the Company nor its directors, officers, employees or advisers shall be held liable for any taxes, interest, penalties or other monetary amounts owed by Executive as a result of the application of Section 409A of the Code.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null, \"Effectiveness\": null, \"Employment\": null, \"Enforceability\": null, \"Enforcements\": null, \"Entire Agreements\": null, \"Erisa\": null, \"Existence\": null, \"Expenses\": null, \"Fees\": null, \"Financial Statements\": null, \"Forfeitures\": null, \"Further Assurances\": null, \"Genera