{"id": "ledgar/test/4763", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"Employee agrees that this Agreement, and its terms and provisions, are strictly confidential and shall not be divulged or disclosed in any way to any person other than Employee's spouse, legal counsel, or tax advisor.  Should Employee choose to divulge the terms and conditions of this Agreement to Employee's spouse, legal counsel, or tax advisor, Employee shall ensure that they will be similarly bound to keep the same confidential.  A breach of this paragraph by Employee's spouse, legal counsel, or tax advisor shall be considered a breach of this paragraph by Employee.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null, \"Effectiveness\": null, \"Employment\": null, \"Enforceability\": null, \"Enforcements\": null, \"Entire Agreements\": null, \"Erisa\": null, \"Existence\": null, \"Expenses\": null, \"Fees\": null, \"Financial Statements\": null, \"Forfeitures\": null, \"Further Assurances\": null, \"General\": null, \"Governing Laws\": null, \"Headings\": null, \"Indemnifications\": null, \"Indemnit